flowchart TD
    A[Order APPROVED or later] --> B["Invoice dashboard /invoices/dashboard - Delivered, to invoice"]
    B --> C["New invoice /invoices/create"]
    C --> D[Select order]
    D --> E{Eligible?}
    E -->|Draft order| E1[Draft orders cannot be invoiced]
    E -->|Status before approval / rejected| E2[Only approved orders can be invoiced]
    E -->|Active invoice exists| E3[Already has invoice - cancel it first]
    E -->|Yes| F[Choose template - default or active template]
    F --> G[Options: quantity basis ORDERED or DELIVERED, invoice date, due date, order discount, shipping, additional charges, demo tax]
    G --> H[Live preview - invoiceCalculationService]
    H --> I{Options valid and grand total > 0?}
    I -->|No| G
    I -->|Yes| J[Issue invoice - number BM-INV-YYYY-NNNNN]
    J --> K[ISSUED - snapshot saved, notification to Admin and Finance, event INVOICE_GENERATED]
    K --> L[Print /invoices/:id/print]
    K --> M[Email - demo]
    K --> N[Customer app - Invoices]
    K --> O{Error found?}
    O -->|Yes| P[Cancel with reason - CANCELLED]
    P --> C
    K --> Q[Finance dashboard and Finance reports]
    Q --> R[Outstanding = customer credit balances - maintained on customer record]
    R --> S([Payments / credit notes - Not Implemented])
